 all it takes to describe the glint in your eye and intense goosebumps – GTS, short for ‘Gran Turismo Sport.’ Pure and thrilling: the Cayenne GTS Coupe brings a motorsport atmosphere to the road with its striking appearance and athletic handling. What’s not to like about this performance machine? The Cayenne GTS Coupe swaps out the V6 engine for a twin-turbocharged V8 unit. It puts out a heady 453 hp and 457 lb-ft of torque, enough juice to really stretch the legs of the GTS Coupe.","image":"https://www.stuttcars.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Porsche-Cayenne-GTS-Coupe.png","tooltipImage":"https://www.stuttcars.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/stuttcars-cayenne-9y3-gts-02-copyright-porsche-500x262.jpg","url":"https://www.stuttcars.com/porsche-cayenne-gts-coupe-2020-present-2/","specs":{"Layout":"Front-engine / V8","Engine":"V8","Displacement":null,"Power":"459 cv","Torque":"620 Nm","Top speed":"269 km/h","0–100 km/h":"4.3 s","Production":null}}},{"id":"Cayenne.GTS.SUV","x":2020,"y":2.82,"name":"Cayenne GTS SUV","color":"rgba(64,66,66,0.52)","selected":false,"custom":{"model":"Cayenne GTS SUV","year":2020,"category":"Misc Models","description":"The V8 engine is back for the Porsche Cayenne GTS. Gone is the twin-turbo V6 and (correctly) the Cayenne GTS now has a twin-turbo V8 with some serious poke (and sound).","image":"https://www.stuttcars.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/PORSCHE-Cayenne-GTS-6843_3.jpeg","tooltipImage":"https://www.stuttcars.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/PORSCHE-Cayenne-GTS-6843_3.jpeg","url":"https://www.stuttcars.com/porsche-cayenne-gts-2020-present-2/","specs":{"Layout":"Front-engine / Architecture not listed","Engine":"Architecture not listed","Displacement":null,"Power":null,"Torque":null,"Top speed":null,"0–100 km/h":null,"Production":null}}},{"id":"Cayenne.Turbo.Coupe","x":2020,"y":2.91,"name":"Cayenne Turbo Coupe","color":"rgba(64,66,66,0.52)","selected":false,"custom":{"model":"Cayenne Turbo Coupe","year":2020,"category":"Misc Models","descri